{
  "name": "Content Ingestion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Process Implementation Guide:-\n\nA fully autonomous n8n workflow that watches a Google Drive folder for new LinkedIn post screenshots/PDFs, extracts and cleans the text, uses AI to pull out reusable writing patterns (hook, structure, tone, formatting, CTA, anti-patterns), embeds them, and stores them in a Pinecone vector store for later reference — with a Supabase log to prevent re-processing the same file twice.\n\n## Setup (credentials needed)\n\n1. **Google Drive OAuth** — watches the /reference-content folder for new files.\n\n2. **Supabase** — used for the reference_ingestions dedupe/log table.\n\n3. **Groq API** — used by the Groq Chat Model for OCR cleanup.\n\n4. **Google Gemini (PaLM) API** — used for pattern-extraction chat model and embeddings.\n\n5. **Pinecone API** — vector store index\n\n6. Activate the workflow once credentials are in place.",
        "height": 684,
        "width": 470
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -512,
        480
      ],
      "id": "e15948e3-4fd4-4eaa-ae98-21b9738fc656",
      "name": "Overview Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Trigger\n\nWatches the Google Drive  folder every minute. Fires on fileCreated — drop a new screenshot or PDF in and the pipeline runs, zero manual input required.",
        "height": 564,
        "width": 432,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        16,
        672
      ],
      "id": "8711341f-7bc5-424d-89ad-db70aa1eb7b7",
      "name": "Trigger Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Dedupe + Download + Type Routing\n\nChecks Supabase for an existing row with this file's ID so the same post is never processed twice. If it's new, downloads the file from Drive, then routes on Data type: **PDF** goes to text extraction, **JPEG** goes to OCR.",
        "height": 484,
        "width": 1012,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        752
      ],
      "id": "b97ce50f-b0aa-4c42-a10d-2cd461bfe115",
      "name": "Dedupe Routing Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Dual-Path Extraction + Normalization\n\nPDFs: text is pulled directly with Extract Text (clean, no LLM pass needed).\n\nImages: run through Tesseract OCR, then a Groq-backed LLM pass (Clean Data) reconstructs broken OCR text into clean readable copy and strips like/comment counts.\n\nBoth paths are normalized into the same {{ text }} shape, then combined with Merge into a single candidate stream for the AI stage.",
        "height": 864,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        320
      ],
      "id": "c9254ec3-ad8a-47bb-b52a-92342e3dad9d",
      "name": "Extraction Normalization Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. AI Pattern Extraction\n\nAn AI Agent analyzes the post NOT to summarize it, but to extract reusable writing patterns: **Hook type**, **Structure**, **Tone**, **Formatting Notes**, **CTA** **Type**, and **Anti-patterns** — returned as strict JSON via the Structured Output Parser.",
        "height": 768,
        "width": 736,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2576,
        208
      ],
      "id": "3bd397d2-cda7-45ef-a3be-6d8c90275abe",
      "name": "AI Extraction Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. Embed + Store + Log\n\nThe extracted pattern fields are flattened into one text blob (with source file id, ingestion timestamp, and hook type as metadata), chunked, embedded with Gemini embeddings, and upserted into the Pinecone index. A row is then logged in Supabase so this file is skipped on future runs.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 1152,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3344,
        400
      ],
      "id": "0c22cd03-f747-4e66-a5d3-896ca5f7cc03",
      "name": "Embed Store Log Note"
    },
