      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Supabase Table: reference_ingestions\n\nRun this once in the Supabase SQL editor before activating the workflow. Used by 'Check For Duplicates' and 'Log to Supabase'.\n\n```sql\ncreate table reference_ingestions (\n id uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),\n source_file_id text not null,\n  file_name text,\n  ingested_at timestamptz not null default now()\n);\n\ncreate index idx_reference_ingestions_source_file_id on reference_ingestions(source_file_id);\n\n\n```",
